<title>USA: Lockheed Martin unit wins Air Force work.</title>
<headline>Lockheed Martin unit wins Air Force work.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Air Force said on Friday it has awarded Lockheed Martin Corp unit Lockheed Martin Tactical Defense Systems a $181 million contract to equip four South Korean Hawker 800 planes with sensors for reconnaissance missions.</p>
<p>The contract includes provision of one fixed and two mobile ground stations, it said.</p>
</text>
